%% Purpose:   Sequence of one purchase: Boris identity + gating, idealo comparison, wallet cap checks
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Teen
    participant GW as Boris Agent Gateway
    participant AG as Family Buyer Agent
    participant LLM as Boris LLM Gateway
    participant ID as idealo MCP
    participant WA as Family Wallet MCP
    Teen->>GW: "Buy the cheapest 'Der Hobbit' paperback"
    GW->>GW: verify caller = teen, visible tools = search + check_budget + place_order
    GW->>AG: request + caller identity
    AG->>LLM: plan (screened, cached)
    AG->>ID: search_products(country=DE)
    ID-->>AG: productRef list
    AG->>ID: get_product_offers(productRef)
    ID-->>AG: offers (price, shipping, shop)
    opt product advertised as reduced
        AG->>ID: check_discount(product, claimed price, history)
        ID-->>AG: verdict (GENUINE, INFLATED, NOT_BEST_PRICE, ...)
    end
    AG->>WA: check_budget(price_cents)
    WA-->>AG: personal 12/50 € · family 210/400 € → OK
    AG->>WA: place_order(product, shop, deep_link, price_cents)
    WA-->>AG: order id + shop deep link
    AG-->>Teen: "Ordered for 9.99 € at Shop X" (no parent needed)
    Note over WA: no member argument: the member comes from the signed token (WALLET_MEMBER_TOKEN)
    Note over WA: child → request_approval instead of place_order<br/>cap exceeded → refused with reason
